<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ICI Australia share buyback approved.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ICI Australia share buyback approved.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI Australia Ltd's minority shareholders on Wednesday overwhelmingly approved on a show of hands the company's proposed buyback of up to 30 million of its shares from its parent ICI Plc.</p>
</text>
